{"version":1,"content":"<p>「第39屆中國電影金雞獎」今晚假廈門舉行，紅地氈上舒淇、郭富城、井柏然、朱一龍、檀健次、梁家輝及此沙等型男索女先後登場，場面星光熠熠。</p><p>頒獎禮於晚上約8時揭開序幕，但早於午4時，廈門文旅已率先於網上發出貼文「披露」賽果，指吳磊及李思潼分別憑《</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T14:41:55.934392+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T14:12:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T14:35:20.070695+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T14:35:20.070695+00:00","content_hash":"d48dac8ba9173a885cb40c57b51af21250cc43baec60c34fa1b929a5a5edc003","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}